  "guest_reuse": "The final cold adjustment changes only selected-buffer guest-address faults while the resource is empty. Final runner repeated the three affected ABI modes, including the original nonempty fault case. Twelve native TCP/CQ/pressure and nine fixed-buffer cases reuse this batch's passing results from the preceding runner; their hashes are retained per row. Final strict all-target compilation passed. Earlier unchanged CPU/GPU/Firefox/Docker/CoreMark and full syscall probes were not rerun.",
  "regressions_fixed": [
    "Connected Unix datagrams were excluded by the old stream-only capability filter. Dedicated ring admission now uses original message queues, empty packets and copied/reported MSG_TRUNC length.",
    "Ring callers resumed from guest sleep ran an owner serial quantum before the next parallel admission check. Recheck only at a ring wake boundary; exact-count native full-CQ tests no longer lose two enters.",
    "A selected invalid guest data VA with an empty source must preserve its buffer and wait for readiness; the new final-source regression test covers EAGAIN then EFAULT without consuming source bytes.",
    "worker_poll_syscalls previously counted only ppoll. It now includes epoll_pwait and epoll_pwait2; historical reports keep their original counting scope."
  ],
